### Batch inventory
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/external-fulfillment/inventory/batch
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","body":{"requests":[{"method":"POST","uri":"/inventory/update?locationId=LOCATION-001&skuId=SKU-001","body":{"quantity":15,"clientSequenceNumber":12345678}}]}}

### List returns
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/external-fulfillment/returns/list
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","query":{"maxResults":"25"}}

### Get return
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/external-fulfillment/returns/detail
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","returnId":"RETURN-001"}

### List shipments
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/external-fulfillment/shipments/list
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","query":{"status":"PENDING","maxResults":"25"}}

### Get shipment
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/external-fulfillment/shipments/detail
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","shipmentId":"SHIPMENT-001"}

### Process shipment
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/external-fulfillment/shipments/process
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","shipmentId":"SHIPMENT-001","query":{"operation":"CONFIRM"}}

### Create packages
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/external-fulfillment/shipments/packages/create
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","shipmentId":"SHIPMENT-001","body":{"packages":[{"packageId":"PACKAGE-001"}]}}

### Update package
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/external-fulfillment/shipments/packages/update
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","shipmentId":"SHIPMENT-001","packageId":"PACKAGE-001","body":{"packageId":"PACKAGE-001"}}

### Update package status
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/external-fulfillment/shipments/packages/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","shipmentId":"SHIPMENT-001","packageId":"PACKAGE-001","query":{"status":"SHIPPED"}}

### Retrieve shipping options
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/external-fulfillment/shipments/shipping-options
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","shipmentId":"SHIPMENT-001","query":{"packageId":"PACKAGE-001"}}

### Generate invoice
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/external-fulfillment/shipments/invoice/generate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","shipmentId":"SHIPMENT-001"}

### Retrieve invoice
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/external-fulfillment/shipments/invoice
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","shipmentId":"SHIPMENT-001"}

### Generate ship labels
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/external-fulfillment/shipments/ship-labels/generate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","shipmentId":"SHIPMENT-001","query":{"operation":"GENERATE"}}
